{
  "name": "Weekly Steam Negative Review Bug & Sentiment Tracker (Apify -> Google Sheets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Steam Negative Review Bug & Sentiment Tracker (Apify -> Google Sheets)\n\nPulls newest negative Steam player reviews every Monday via Valve's current API, filters out drive-by refunds under `minPlaytimeHours`, tags bug `priority` (`HIGH` / `MEDIUM` / `NORMAL`), and upserts into Google Sheets.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n- Set `APIFY_TOKEN` in n8n Environment Variables (Apify's free $5/month credit covers testing).\n- Connect a Google Sheets OAuth2 credential and replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 450,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Overview & Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [140, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Schedule & Game App IDs\n\nEdit **Configure Steam Apps** with any Steam numeric App IDs or store URLs, `language`, and minimum `minPlaytimeHours` before a review is triaged.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-config",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 1 Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, 560]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Scrape & Filter Player Reports\n\nCalls **67-labs/steam-reviews-scraper** on Apify, removes empty/short drive-by reviews below `minPlaytimeHours`, and deduplicates by `reviewId`.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-extract",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 2 Scrape & Filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [680, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 3: Priority Triage & Upsert Sheet\n\nFlags high-vote or veteran-hour negative reviews (`HIGH` / `MEDIUM` / `NORMAL`) and upserts clean rows into Google Sheets matched by `reviewId`.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-sheets",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Step 3 Triage & Sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1280, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [1],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-weekly",
      "name": "Weekly Monday Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [200, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "Manual Test Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-apps",
              "name": "apps",
              "value": "={{ [\"730\", \"1172470\"] }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-max",
              "name": "maxReviews",
              "value": 100,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-lang",
              "name": "language",
              "value": "english",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-hours",
              "name": "minPlaytimeHours",
              "value": 2,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "configure-apps",
      "name": "Configure Steam Apps",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [440, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/67-labs~steam-reviews-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{ $env.APIFY_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ apps: $json.apps, maxReviews: $json.maxReviews, sort: 'newest', reviewType: 'negative', language: $json.language }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-steam",
      "name": "Scrape Steam Negative Reviews (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [700, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-text",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.text || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-playtime",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.playtimeAtReviewHours || 0) }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ Number($('Configure Steam Apps').item.json.minPlaytimeHours) }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-reviews",
      "name": "Filter Detailed Player Reviews",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [940, 380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeDuplicateInputItems",
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": {
          "fields": [
            {
              "fieldName": "reviewId"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dedupe-review",
      "name": "Deduplicate by Review ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1160, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "out-id",
              "name": "reviewId",
              "value": "={{ $json.reviewId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-app-id",
              "name": "appId",
              "value": "={{ $json.appId || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-app-name",
              "name": "appName",
              "value": "={{ $json.appName || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-date",
              "name": "date",
              "value": "={{ $json.date || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-hours",
              "name": "playtimeAtReviewHours",
              "value": "={{ $json.playtimeAtReviewHours ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-votes",
              "name": "votesUp",
              "value": "={{ $json.votesUp ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-priority",
              "name": "priority",
              "value": "={{ ($json.votesUp || 0) >= 10 ? 'HIGH' : (($json.playtimeAtReviewHours || 0) >= 20 ? 'MEDIUM' : 'NORMAL') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-ea",
              "name": "earlyAccess",
              "value": "={{ Boolean($json.earlyAccess) }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-text",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $json.text || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-url",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.url || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out-scraped",
              "name": "scrapedAt",
              "value": "={{ $json.scrapedAt || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-review",
      "name": "Format Bug Triage Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1380, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": ["reviewId"]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert Reviews to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1600, 320]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
